      en: ["Pitești is the 12th largest city in Romania by population.", "The city's name is derived from the Romanian word 'pitit' (hidden).", "The A1 motorway was completed in 1972, connecting Pitești to the capital.", "The Pitești Experiment is considered one of the most cruel re-education programs.", "The Tulip Symphony features over 50,000 tulips of various species.", "The city serves as a gateway to the Transfăgărășan mountain road.", "Pitești has a significant petrochemical industry alongside car manufacturing.", "The local Trivale Park is a large forest-park used for recreation."],
