      en: ["First documented as a settlement in the year 1368.", "Home to Alro, the largest aluminum plant in Southeast Europe.", "Birthplace of the famous playwright Eugen Ionescu.", "Features one of the oldest bridges over the Olt River.", "Located approximately 50 kilometers northeast of Craiova.", "Annual host of the unique Oltenia Humor Festival."],
